"将燃料电池 8 号端口的 UART 连接到飞控的任意串口。`参阅设备用户手册 <https://www.intelligent-"
"energy.com/our-products/support/>`__ 了解 8 号端口的位置。只需连接 GND、UART TX 和 UART "
"RX。请参阅下图："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:38
#: 0e5829e5d1a7437fad8c7bb73b809d8d 3074ac0bf8f746eab1811350ab54a53c
#: 6cbf784e73934f2aa41246720d80c7fb 950877e596cd42cda56c8557ace911a7
#: d27009b2d473479a81d2c9218724ecf3
