msgstr "就绪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:74
#: 17e0e82068eb4dd586300c6cf6ebd88e 5b0499f69d1d4555a3db32cddd03d5d6
#: 72f1b67674b54475ade0b33f708f9423 9309d66bf6bd4be08e6d0a703f61f919
#: f53a3689008149b896817f6658bed8ee
msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:75
#: 0dfdbe133de64d98a7f056a35b4ab351 537000ebb23e42398ad9de5edd50df5e
#: a12d11e0c8384a6ba4bbb9e9cd907ed5 c4672ea0d3b240e4bfeb9487eadf9c3c
#: ccda3b27deee4a4a943fe0fec1c9fd21
msgid "Fault"
msgstr "故障"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:76
#: 1c3664af5f054b6e8c8e806ac554c8f8 2e42cfac4f3847e68a10a20838e6cf6d
#: 4581620a558e46b9a61edbcf5d443cb9 eb7deaf3b9614a3f9f8e75e93c9a680f
#: f8987796fe374a728b57aa63a3aa34b1
msgid "Battery Only"
msgstr "仅电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:78
#: 09dd20db2d9b4711972e8da2fe4e7b33 15189eede5864335b299d95ddaa97b48
#: 6a4507f54f1b4fbbb1e9beaaac9f4836 96d1c9c0a30743f484c57957ed26e1e8
#: ad60c85a69c34e0494e3200c15349208
msgid ""
"A message will be displayed on the GCS and in the flight log whenever the "
"fuel cell status changes.  The vehicle can only be armed when the fuel cell "
"is reporting a status of 'Running'."
msgstr "每当燃料电池状态改变时，地面站和飞行日志中都会显示一条消息。只有当燃料电池报告「运行中」状态时，飞行器才能解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:82
#: 12ede72a8f3b4a36bfef8c16103c9f3f 248d20249ba24f57be48b454c09b974a
#: 405a4e9b64384650bf47002064f32ad2 63ce3ba336a74167bb53a11849a5df0a
#: 77f1bff2321d4cb3bea3169ef7100d34
msgid "Failsafes and Pre-Arm Checks"
msgstr "失控保护和预解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:84
#: 308109087b444286b550b74d89acabbd 83c651c8833f4e70955c4fe6d4532195
#: 88198208bf6f40718011a64f8f24f44c e565763312a249fd835c958ef59509a2
#: fa9c994a370d47a1af243c10565e8141
msgid ""
"Failsafes and pre-arm checks are hard-coded and based on the error codes "
"sent by the fuel cell.  Failsafes have been separated into two groups: Low "
"and Critical.  The error code groups are listed below.  If an error code is "
"received from the fuel cell, the resulting failsafe action will be set by "
"the :ref:`BATTX_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` and :ref:`BATTX_FS_CRT_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` respectively."
msgstr ""
"失控保护和预解锁检查是硬编码的，基于燃料电池发送的错误代码。失控保护分为两组：低级和严重。错误代码分组如下。当收到燃料电池的错误代码时，相应的失控保护动作分别由"
" :ref:`BATTX_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 和 :ref:`BATTX_FS_CRT_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` 设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ie24-fuelcell.rst:87
#: 5d16bfa1dd8f4e43937923c507acf366 8c14abd30b7b4c37a282869a71f865ec
#: a1f5eba262b44d83bd11648364e0b7e4 bdf1e020aa044b0b82e4334865567374
#: d40f04a670c74f48a3d5acc3a2046387
msgid ""
"Monitoring of the fuel cell's internal error codes for pre-arm checks and "
"failsafes are only done on the battery monitor instance allocated for the "
"electrical telemetry.  The electrical battery monitor instance must "
"therefore be set to trigger failsafes based on error codes."
msgstr ""
"燃料电池内部错误代码的预解锁检查和失控保护监测仅在分配给电气数传的电池监测实例上进行。因此，电气电池监测实例必须设置为基于错误代码触发失控保护。"

